>     *   Agricultural development programs, like the Wadi initiative, can "significantly reduce the frequency and intensity of seasonal migration by increasing agricultural productivity through integrated farming systems" and providing "alternative income sources," thereby fostering resilience and potentially different agricultural investment choices.
